WEBVTT

00:04.400 --> 00:10.030
I have always believed

00:10.160 --> 00:14.540
終わらない夢を握りしめて

00:10.160 --> 00:14.540
owaranai yume wo nigiri shimete

00:10.160 --> 00:14.540
in taking hold of that endless dream.

00:14.540 --> 00:17.830
TRUST ME MY WAY

00:27.550 --> 00:31.470
DON'T MIND 時にこの想い

00:27.550 --> 00:31.470
DON'T MIND toki ni kono omoi

00:27.550 --> 00:31.470
I don't mind... sometimes feeling like

00:31.470 --> 00:34.180
空回りするけど

00:31.470 --> 00:34.180
karamawari suru kedo

00:31.470 --> 00:34.180
I'm just spinning my wheels, but...

00:34.640 --> 00:37.850
‘ちょっとポジティブ’がいいんじゃない？

00:34.640 --> 00:37.850
chotto POJITIBU ga iinjanai

00:34.640 --> 00:37.850
Why don't you act a little more positive?

00:37.980 --> 00:41.570
自分らしいキャラでいい

00:37.980 --> 00:41.570
jibunrashii KYARA de ii

00:37.980 --> 00:41.570
You should be yourself.

00:41.690 --> 00:47.410
でもね... ハチャメチャなシナリオは

00:41.690 --> 00:47.410
demo nee... HACHAMECHA na SHINARIO wa

00:41.690 --> 00:47.410
But you know, a messed up scenario

00:49.070 --> 00:54.580
愛すべき 未来に変わって いく

00:49.070 --> 00:54.580
aisubeki asu ni kawatte iku

00:49.070 --> 00:54.580
will turn into a lovable tomorrow.

00:54.580 --> 00:56.080
TRUST MY WAY

00:56.120 --> 01:01.540
THE WIND 頬をなでる

00:56.120 --> 01:01.540
THE WIND hoho wo naderu

00:56.120 --> 01:01.540
The wind, it caresses my cheek.

01:01.800 --> 01:05.220
風と-緒に心地好く

01:01.800 --> 01:05.220
kaze to issho ni kokochiyoku

01:01.800 --> 01:05.220
Together with this comfortable breeze,

01:05.220 --> 01:10.100
楽しめる速度でこれからも

01:05.220 --> 01:10.100
tanoshimeru sokudo de kore kara mo

01:05.220 --> 01:10.100
and at a rate I also enjoy,

01:10.220 --> 01:15.730
ずっと変わらない想い

01:10.220 --> 01:15.730
zutto kawaranai omoi

01:10.220 --> 01:15.730
these feelings won't ever change.

01:15.980 --> 01:20.310
終わらない夢を握りしめて

01:15.980 --> 01:20.310
owaranai yume wo nigirishimete

01:15.980 --> 01:20.310
I"m taking hold of that endless dream.

01:20.310 --> 01:23.940
TRUST ME MY WAY

01:33.020 --> 01:39.760
The proceeds from the sale of simple commodities from your first live show yesterday came to ¥8,372,650.

01:40.170 --> 01:43.090
In addition, you have your formal contract bonus of ¥60,000,000.

01:43.330 --> 01:46.530
This comprises the sum we are paying you now.

01:46.530 --> 01:48.920
All the bills shown are ¥10,000 denominations, which is worth about US$107 as of July 2009.

01:48.920 --> 01:50.840
This is all money?

01:51.030 --> 01:53.950
It is the real thing, paid as compensation to you, Izumi-sama.

01:54.060 --> 01:57.740
Even if you paid off the debt, you'd still have ¥3,000 left over, Onee-san!

01:54.060 --> 01:57.740
Mitsuki is mistaken by a factor of one hundred. If Izumi paid off her debt, she would actually have ¥375,560 left over.

01:57.870 --> 01:59.600
This isn't a dream, is it?

01:59.680 --> 02:00.720
It might be a dream.

02:01.030 --> 02:02.120
It's not!

02:02.210 --> 02:03.490
This is real!

02:03.660 --> 02:04.370
I did it!

02:04.540 --> 02:05.690
I can repay my debt!

02:07.440 --> 02:09.190
I'm free now!

02:10.060 --> 02:11.040
Hurray!

02:13.500 --> 02:18.510
He is My Prince!?

02:19.290 --> 02:21.020
Yoshitaka-kun, please wake up.

02:21.350 --> 02:22.270
Hey, wake up!

02:23.140 --> 02:23.890
Mitsuki-chan...

02:24.690 --> 02:26.340
Lemme sleep a lil longer...

02:29.210 --> 02:30.020
That hurt!

02:30.270 --> 02:31.710
J- Wh-What the...?

02:32.770 --> 02:33.870
Oh, Anna-chan, good morning.

02:34.290 --> 02:36.050
It felt like someone just kicked me out of bed!

02:36.560 --> 02:37.490
No way, Anna-chan?

02:37.580 --> 02:39.990
Your sleeping posture was bad and you fell out of bed.

02:40.140 --> 02:42.760
It's unusual for you to come wake me up, Anna-chan.

02:43.160 --> 02:44.360
Why don't you say how you're feeling?

02:44.740 --> 02:46.130
What are you talking about?

02:46.320 --> 02:48.710
You and I have a relationship, don't we, Yoshitaka-kun?

02:50.330 --> 02:51.100
Something's fishy!

02:51.740 --> 02:53.540
Now, please hurry and get up.

02:53.730 --> 02:56.170
Mitsuki-chan is waiting to prepare your breakfast.

02:56.620 --> 02:58.130
Y-You're planning something, aren't you?

02:58.310 --> 03:00.250
I can't believe you're treating me so nicely!

03:02.070 --> 03:02.850
Oh, no...

03:03.270 --> 03:05.660
I was just doing it for my beloved Yoshitaka-kun!

03:06.350 --> 03:08.680
But you're being so cruel...

03:08.950 --> 03:09.690
A-All right!

03:10.360 --> 03:11.370
I'm sorry, Anna-chan.

03:11.560 --> 03:13.320
Yoshitaka, it's time to wake up.

03:13.450 --> 03:15.180
Okay, I came to get you up.

03:15.260 --> 03:17.420
Ah, uh, bu- Wh-

03:15.260 --> 03:16.110
Well, then, bye-bye.

03:16.150 --> 03:17.420
You can be late if you want.

03:18.720 --> 03:19.200
Izumi.

03:20.210 --> 03:21.710
WHAT ARE YOU DOING, YOSHITAKA?!

03:22.080 --> 03:22.740
Anna-chan!

03:22.910 --> 03:23.950
What did Yoshitaka do to you?

03:24.070 --> 03:25.320
Don't put up with it!

03:25.560 --> 03:27.490
Please don't be violent with Yoshitaka-kun!

03:27.580 --> 03:28.250
Huh?

03:28.870 --> 03:30.850
Anna-chan.... what happened?

03:31.090 --> 03:32.560
I've opened my eyes!

03:32.700 --> 03:34.830
Relationships between women are no good after all!

03:35.090 --> 03:38.490
From now on I'm going to go after Yoshitaka-kun, just as I was from the beginning!

03:38.830 --> 03:40.400
No, you can't do that!

03:41.120 --> 03:41.810
Izumi-san...

03:42.220 --> 03:44.420
I'm... serious.

03:47.060 --> 03:49.130
Ha! You shouldn't meddle in other people's business!

03:49.450 --> 03:51.790
Or do you have feelings for Anna-chan after a-

03:52.690 --> 03:53.860
Of course not!

03:54.440 --> 03:56.570
Ann-chan is free to go out with whomever she wants,

03:56.740 --> 03:58.370
but I won't allow it to be you, Yoshitaka!

03:58.470 --> 03:59.280
I see.

03:59.450 --> 04:01.370
So you're jealous, huh?

04:01.630 --> 04:03.780
The fact that I'm taken hurt that much?

04:04.230 --> 04:05.080
No!

04:05.210 --> 04:07.100
So then you really do like Anna-chan?

04:07.320 --> 04:08.390
Ah! You're getting on my nerves!

04:08.590 --> 04:12.000
Yoshitaka-kun and I have a love-love relationship.

04:12.210 --> 04:14.050
So please don't interfere, Izumi-san!

04:14.200 --> 04:15.260
You said it!

04:15.590 --> 04:16.900
I'll be sure to make you hap-

04:20.610 --> 04:22.610
M-My head was just itchy.

04:23.730 --> 04:25.580
Anna-chan, you can't do this after all.

04:26.150 --> 04:30.030
If you fall into Yoshitaka's hands, your life will amount to nothing!

04:30.420 --> 04:32.180
Well, let's find out if that's true!

04:32.430 --> 04:35.210
It's the Yoshitaka-kun ❤ Anna-san Love-Love competition!

04:35.400 --> 04:38.430
It looks like Nakabayashi and Sawatari-san are having a contest over Kurauchi!

04:38.510 --> 04:40.870
So Sawatari-san swings that way after all?

04:41.080 --> 04:42.900
I guess it's starting again...

04:43.080 --> 04:46.040
We're going to judge the extent of Master and Anna-san's love-love!

04:46.120 --> 04:47.030
I accept!

04:47.230 --> 04:48.730
I'll show you the strength of our bond!

04:49.720 --> 04:51.080
Right, Anna-chan?

04:52.460 --> 04:53.840
A-All right!

04:54.130 --> 04:54.920
Let's do our best.

04:55.140 --> 04:59.970
First of all, cooking for and nursing Master has already been done, so...

05:00.720 --> 05:01.470
Ah, that's it!

05:01.760 --> 05:03.860
You're going to express your love for each other!

05:04.610 --> 05:05.550
You can do it, right?

05:05.770 --> 05:06.990
O-Of course!

05:07.360 --> 05:08.350
We're going to do it in front of all these people?

05:08.600 --> 05:09.740
I-I feel a little awkward.

05:11.360 --> 05:13.030
Now then, let's begin with Master!

05:15.090 --> 05:17.940
Were I to compare a flower such as this to your beauty,

05:17.970 --> 05:20.820
It would appear to be nothing more than trash, but I offer it to you...

05:21.320 --> 05:23.420
as I offer my timid heart.

05:30.070 --> 05:33.140
Now then... it's Anna-san's turn.

05:33.270 --> 05:33.990
How embarrassing.

05:36.210 --> 05:44.260
mumbling

05:36.620 --> 05:40.810
You are like a rainbow, over which the faraway North Star glitters as the forbidden Venus

05:40.890 --> 05:44.120
descends through the non-Euclidean, hooved-shaped void of space to the mountain where,

05:44.300 --> 05:46.550
on a fall day, the diamond-like violin star of a wild beast...

05:46.550 --> 05:47.100
Huh?

05:47.500 --> 05:49.870
W-Well, what's your decision, Onee-chan?

05:50.820 --> 05:52.700
Umm, I don't really understand.

05:53.010 --> 05:56.180
But it didn't seem like either one really put any love into it.

05:56.330 --> 05:57.940
Well, Onee-chan, what would <i>you</i> say?

05:58.020 --> 05:59.390
I-I'm going to do it?

05:59.510 --> 06:00.640
It's an experiment, an experiment!

06:01.740 --> 06:04.930
Well, even if it's an experiment, I don't want to say it to Yoshitaka, so I'll say it to Anna-chan.

06:05.870 --> 06:08.230
Hey, wai- Huh? Huh? Huh? Huh?

06:08.230 --> 06:10.740
You are my bright, shining morning star.

06:11.170 --> 06:13.970
I offer all that I am to you.

06:14.330 --> 06:17.320
No matter what anyone says, I want you to always stay by my side.

06:19.180 --> 06:20.210
I understand!

06:20.580 --> 06:22.250
Let's get married right away!

06:23.980 --> 06:27.270
U-Um, that was so realistic that I just kind of...

06:27.680 --> 06:29.720
I-I was just talking!

06:29.600 --> 06:30.430
Anna-chan...

06:30.710 --> 06:32.220
Something's definitely fishy here.

06:32.350 --> 06:34.060
Anna-chan, are you plotting something?

06:34.150 --> 06:35.370
Ah, u-um...

06:35.310 --> 06:35.980
Hey, Izumi!

06:35.980 --> 06:37.710
Don't meddle in what's none of your business!

06:37.840 --> 06:38.960
What do you mean "none of my business"?!

06:39.240 --> 06:40.860
This problem is between me and Anna-chan!

06:41.040 --> 06:43.750
Anna-chan says she likes me, so isn't that enough?

06:43.990 --> 06:45.660
Just because you got rejected, don't take it out of us!

06:45.660 --> 06:46.520
That's so unsightly!

06:46.520 --> 06:47.120
Wha-

06:47.160 --> 06:47.700
Reje-

06:48.120 --> 06:50.410
Why don't you take Anna-chan's feeling into consideration?

06:50.840 --> 06:52.730
You were cast aside by Anna-chan!

06:54.080 --> 06:54.850
Hah, you loser!

06:54.990 --> 06:55.820
You got rejected!

06:55.850 --> 06:56.540
She hates you!

06:56.620 --> 06:59.100
Go drown your sorrows in alcohol!

06:59.240 --> 07:02.160
Meanwhile, I'll show you conclusive proof of our love!

07:10.920 --> 07:12.500
I CAN'T DO THIS AFTER ALL!

07:12.920 --> 07:13.850
Anna-chan!

07:13.930 --> 07:15.070
Wh-What's going on?

07:15.770 --> 07:16.700
U-Um...

07:18.020 --> 07:19.060
Izumi-san!

07:19.440 --> 07:21.630
Yoshitaka-kun threatened me!

07:21.780 --> 07:22.690
He used my weakness against me.

07:23.030 --> 07:25.070
He said he'd give away the secret videos!

07:25.840 --> 07:26.430
Yoshitaka!

07:26.500 --> 07:26.860
Huh?

07:27.030 --> 07:27.490
Hey wai-

07:27.780 --> 07:28.580
Wh-What are you talking about?

07:28.850 --> 07:30.560
SO THAT'S WHAT THIS WAS ABOUT?!

07:30.730 --> 07:32.410
Die, you worm!

07:33.010 --> 07:35.640
Anna-san, why don't you go ahead and tell the truth?

07:35.640 --> 07:36.500
All right.

07:35.640 --> 07:36.500
Pervert!

07:37.840 --> 07:39.990
It was a setup?!

07:40.180 --> 07:40.880
Yes.

07:41.040 --> 07:45.340
I was worried that you might leave the house, Izumi-san.

07:45.620 --> 07:47.670
So I had a talk with Mitsuki-chan.

07:47.920 --> 07:48.760
And then...

07:49.170 --> 07:50.850
Well then, be unfaithful!

07:51.140 --> 07:51.990
...is what she told me.

07:52.310 --> 07:55.150
If I made it look like I was interested in Yoshitaka-kun,

07:55.380 --> 07:57.910
I thought Izumi-san would come around.

07:58.050 --> 07:59.480
That's so mean, Anna-chan...

07:59.630 --> 08:02.000
I got used in another one of Mitsuki's schemes...

08:02.400 --> 08:05.060
There's no way I would ever be unfaithful.

08:05.410 --> 08:08.040
I was sure that if I could make her mine in one fell swoop,

08:08.250 --> 08:10.960
Izumi-san wouldn't talk about leaving.

08:11.410 --> 08:13.350
You don't have to worry about that, Anna-chan.

08:13.690 --> 08:14.870
Even though I can repay my debt,

08:14.910 --> 08:16.970
I don't plan on leaving anytime soon.

08:17.180 --> 08:18.760
Izumi-san, does that mean...

08:20.740 --> 08:21.630
I see!

08:21.840 --> 08:24.140
That means you don't want to be separated from me after all!

08:24.630 --> 08:25.810
Jeez, you're persistent!

08:26.160 --> 08:28.020
Um, don't misunderstand me, Anna-chan.

08:28.100 --> 08:31.370
Even if we leave here, there's still the matter of a place for Pochi...

08:31.540 --> 08:36.060
No matter what you say, Izumi-san, I'll only have eyes for you from now on!

08:36.320 --> 08:37.770
I'll have my eyes on you, too!

08:37.890 --> 08:39.000
Around the clock!

08:39.110 --> 08:40.630
Yours are all hidden cameras!

08:40.780 --> 08:43.170
You're as unsightly as always, Yoshitaka.

08:45.400 --> 08:46.060
You're...

08:46.690 --> 08:47.210
Who?

08:47.650 --> 08:48.800
My penniless cousin.

08:48.860 --> 08:50.190
WHO'S PENNILESS?!

09:03.010 --> 09:04.250
<i>My parents died.</i>

09:05.090 --> 09:06.070
<i>It was a traffic accident.</i>

09:06.830 --> 09:08.600
<i>My inheritance was enormous,</i>

09:09.300 --> 09:12.060
<i>but for someone like me, who had never so much as cleaned my own room,</i>

09:12.400 --> 09:18.840
<i>it was necessary to have people who could look after me so that I could continue my lifestyle.</i>

09:14.600 --> 09:16.180
Inquire Within for Details

09:14.600 --> 09:16.180
Hiring Servants

09:14.800 --> 09:16.180
Urgently Hiring

09:20.620 --> 09:21.670
Master.

09:22.240 --> 09:23.350
Master!

09:23.900 --> 09:26.870
Master, I failed to hear the buzzer.

09:27.420 --> 09:30.350
I'm sorry, but please make do with Cup Ramen for the rest of breakfast.

09:31.770 --> 09:33.200
What the hell are you giving this to me for?!

09:33.350 --> 09:35.680
I can't eat something in this condition!

09:35.750 --> 09:39.700
I'm sorry, but I left all such caretakings to the ladies before their retirement.

09:39.950 --> 09:42.600
You should have practiced and learned from them, then.

09:42.840 --> 09:46.440
I only have a short time here until I, too, am old enough to receive my pension.

09:47.120 --> 09:49.770
Until then, I just have to make ends meet somehow.

09:49.990 --> 09:53.450
Someone like you who has <i>never</i> known hardship would not understand, Master.

09:54.360 --> 09:56.160
Ah, I'm sorry. Those are the complaints of a servant.

09:56.550 --> 09:58.910
Damn it. That really pisses me off!

09:59.260 --> 10:01.640
<i>And on the other hand, that bastard Yoshitaka...</i>

10:01.750 --> 10:03.630
<i>He has it made, being surrounded by three cute maids,</i>

10:03.880 --> 10:06.270
<i>living a fun and interesting life!</i>

10:06.540 --> 10:08.860
How is it that he and I, who have had almost the same lot in life,

10:08.900 --> 10:11.160
are living so differently?!

10:11.520 --> 10:15.020
<i>At that time, I found Izumi-san's photo album on the Internet.</i>

10:16.290 --> 10:17.160
<i>Upon further investigation,</i>

10:17.450 --> 10:21.670
<i>I found out that Izumi-san was being made to work in an indecent outfit to repay a debt!</i>

10:22.500 --> 10:23.600
<i>My poor Izumi-san!</i>

10:23.800 --> 10:25.890
<i>I can't believe you're by the side of such a strange guy!</i>

10:26.320 --> 10:28.880
Anyway, I can't leave a woman to suffer!

10:28.990 --> 10:30.210
No matter what I have to do,

10:30.260 --> 10:32.820
I will bring Izumi-san into this house!

10:33.550 --> 10:34.580
And that's the story.

10:35.070 --> 10:37.960
I picked out those pictures of Onee-chan!

10:38.110 --> 10:39.190
That's all fine and good,

10:39.310 --> 10:41.550
but you got careless and forgot to say your own name.

10:41.700 --> 10:42.660
Yeah, who are you?

10:42.940 --> 10:44.060
It's not as large as mine,

10:44.330 --> 10:46.740
but he's a bastard who received an inheritance and waves it around like the nouveau rich he is.

10:44.330 --> 10:46.740
Nouveau rich (Fr. "newly rich") is a term used to describe those who attain their wealth within their generation, as opposed to someone who is old money.

10:47.060 --> 10:50.310
My master is also the president of my production company.

10:50.400 --> 10:52.310
Nakabayashi Seiichirou-sama!

10:52.540 --> 10:55.820
Forgive me, Izumi-san, for not introducing myself until now.

10:56.490 --> 11:01.370
But this is the only way I could save you from Yoshitaka's clutches.

11:01.610 --> 11:02.870
If I had been found out in the meantime,

11:02.950 --> 11:05.850
I'm not sure what kind of suffering you would have endured at the hands of Yoshitaka.

11:06.110 --> 11:07.590
Everything is all right, now.

11:07.780 --> 11:08.480
A-All right!

11:09.220 --> 11:12.830
Then do you mean that my contract money was to help me too?

11:13.030 --> 11:13.630
Seiichirou!

11:13.670 --> 11:14.630
You've already lost!

11:14.730 --> 11:15.930
At what?

11:17.300 --> 11:20.930
No matter what you say, that contract money is Izumi-san's legitimate revenue!

11:21.490 --> 11:25.460
Izumi-san will officially come into my service as an exclusive property of my office!

11:25.680 --> 11:26.530
I'm sorry.

11:27.260 --> 11:31.920
Izumi-san, I know that you weren't trying to become an idol of your own free will.

11:32.150 --> 11:37.990
But this was the only way to rescue you from the devious machinations of Yoshitaka.

11:39.060 --> 11:40.310
Can you forgive me?

11:41.940 --> 11:44.030
He is my prince!

11:44.770 --> 11:46.190
That's... quite all right.

11:46.650 --> 11:49.290
I can't believe that you would go to such lengths for me.

11:49.500 --> 11:53.210
How can you say that? You plan on hiring Izumi and then taking advantage of her weakness

11:53.240 --> 11:54.740
so you can sexually harass her, don't you?

11:55.190 --> 11:56.500
Like I said, don't compare me to you!

11:56.610 --> 11:57.620
That's right, dumbass!

11:58.770 --> 12:01.910
Ah, so God really <i>was</i> watching over me!

12:05.650 --> 12:06.570
Hold on!

12:07.030 --> 12:09.270
You trust this guy after you just met him for the first time?

12:09.810 --> 12:11.410
That's right. What about you, Mitsuki-chan?

12:11.760 --> 12:12.730
Let me think.

12:13.110 --> 12:15.290
He seems a little too normal, which is boring.

12:15.520 --> 12:17.480
You look like much more fun, Master!

12:17.580 --> 12:18.240
Normal is fine!

12:18.660 --> 12:19.340
Normal!

12:19.590 --> 12:21.350
Then let's have a contest!

12:21.480 --> 12:23.600
The Rapid-Fire Otaku Quiz!

12:23.930 --> 12:24.700
Why are you having a quiz?!

12:24.700 --> 12:26.070
And even worse... an <i>otaku</i> quiz?!

12:26.160 --> 12:28.630
Our master<i> has</i> to be an otaku!

12:28.770 --> 12:30.190
Otherwise, the viewers wouldn't accept it!

12:30.450 --> 12:34.090
If you win, Seiichirou-kun, we'll work at your house!

12:34.480 --> 12:37.970
If Master wins, we'll work here just like we have until now.

12:38.210 --> 12:40.970
In addition, he'll want something from Seiichirou-kun, won't he?

12:41.130 --> 12:41.900
She's ignoring me.

12:42.150 --> 12:45.410
All right, if I lose, I'll give you my servant.

12:45.590 --> 12:46.370
Me?

12:46.430 --> 12:47.510
You think I want <i>him</i>?

12:47.750 --> 12:49.400
It's all right, Master.

12:49.710 --> 12:51.150
Please leave it to me!

12:51.260 --> 12:52.370
R-Really?

12:52.870 --> 12:54.240
If you say so, Mitsuki-chan.

12:54.540 --> 12:56.090
Now then, let's start!

12:56.700 --> 12:58.710
The first to get three questions right wins!

12:59.060 --> 13:04.190
In <i>Space Battleship Yamato</i>, what is the Gamilas word meaning "Form up and mount the tanks!"?

13:05.080 --> 13:08.410
Rapid-Fire Otaku

13:05.330 --> 13:06.080
Seiichirou-kun?

13:06.320 --> 13:07.310
Tsubakukansaruma!

13:07.450 --> 13:08.190
Correct!

13:08.900 --> 13:11.660
How do you know something like that, Seiichirou-kun?

13:11.770 --> 13:13.460
I was lucky.

13:13.590 --> 13:16.930
Incidentally, the script for this part had it written ×△〇,

13:13.590 --> 13:16.930
Gibberish or nonsense words in Japanese can be represented by various non-phonetic characters - the "backwards reading: of these characters that Seiichirou refers to

13:17.000 --> 13:19.420
but the voice actors thought it would be clever to read it backwards...

13:17.000 --> 13:19.420
is simply the names of the characters below read backwards according to the Japanese syllabry. ×='batsu', △='sankaku', and 〇='maru'.

13:19.420 --> 13:28.060
Otaku Quiz Contestants

13:22.230 --> 13:25.460
...is something that Yoshitaka bragged to me about once before!

13:25.870 --> 13:27.280
I just have a good memory!

13:27.380 --> 13:28.180
Really?

13:28.260 --> 13:29.250
The next question!

13:29.300 --> 13:31.470
The birthplace of Anno-san, Tomomi-chan, and Mattsuu is?

13:29.300 --> 13:31.470
Anno-san is Anno Hideaki, director of Neon Genesis Evangelion and other Gainax work. Tomomi-chan is the popular name for Tomomi Nishimura, a Japanese idol who made her debut in 1986. Mattsu is the author of HiMM manga, whom you saw a minute ago as a glasses-wearing alligator.

13:31.880 --> 13:32.920
Ube City in the Yamaguchi prefecture!

13:33.930 --> 13:36.330
The God of Death Hell Bullet Leo Shooting Star Magnum is...

13:36.850 --> 13:38.280
Prince Zabitan's certain-death move!

13:36.850 --> 13:38.280
Prince Zabitan is a character in the gag manga "Lizard King" (リザードキング), first published in anthology form in 1989 and reprinted in 1993.

13:39.010 --> 13:39.610
I did it!

13:39.740 --> 13:40.510
I won!

13:40.730 --> 13:42.200
Now, let's go, Izumi-san!

13:42.610 --> 13:44.850
I'll be taking Izumi-san as promised.

13:45.130 --> 13:47.500
I take it you have no objections, you loser?

13:47.640 --> 13:49.110
Th-That's ridiculous...

13:49.400 --> 13:52.320
The match goes to the first to win three contests!

13:52.450 --> 13:54.420
You forfeit if you leave now!

13:54.520 --> 13:55.320
WHAT?!

13:56.060 --> 13:57.480
Th-That's terrible, Mitsuki-chan!

13:57.600 --> 13:58.670
Making up something like that up after the fact-

14:02.250 --> 14:03.030
Kumeshin-san?

14:03.460 --> 14:04.860
Shouldn't he at least<i> say</i> something?

14:05.010 --> 14:06.800
Now then, let's go to the next event!

14:07.370 --> 14:09.500
We'll continue with the Figurine Construction Contest!

14:09.880 --> 14:12.610
The theme is "She is My Ideal Maid"!

14:10.730 --> 14:12.560
Make a

14:10.730 --> 14:12.560
Maid!

14:13.650 --> 14:14.680
I won't lose this time!

14:14.750 --> 14:16.230
This field is my absolute specialty!

14:16.380 --> 14:18.800
Master has set to work with incredible intensity!

14:19.050 --> 14:21.160
That face already looks like he's on the verge of committing a crime!

14:21.370 --> 14:25.090
How long will Seiichirou-kun be able to square off against Master in the end?

14:25.430 --> 14:28.530
Can amateurs even make figurines?

14:28.750 --> 14:30.460
That's too much of a handicap...

14:30.890 --> 14:31.620
It's done!

14:31.790 --> 14:33.150
She is my ideal erotic maid!

14:33.270 --> 14:34.500
That's our Master!

14:34.530 --> 14:35.460
It's incredibly well-made!

14:35.630 --> 14:38.350
IT'S NOTHING BUT A CONTINUOUS STRING OF SEXUAL HARASSMENT WITH YOU, ISN'T IT?!

14:40.330 --> 14:43.630
Now, let's see if Seiichirou-kun was able to finish!

14:50.410 --> 14:51.220
It's incredible...

14:51.350 --> 14:51.840
I lose.

14:52.120 --> 14:52.790
How 'bout that?

14:52.900 --> 14:55.710
U-um... Why are you able to make things like that?

14:55.860 --> 14:57.400
Don't tell me you like that kind of thing...

14:57.760 --> 14:58.900
Come now, Izumi-san!

14:59.190 --> 15:00.760
There's no way I would!

15:00.950 --> 15:02.960
Truth be told, I'm in the Art Club.

15:02.960 --> 15:03.490
Ah!

15:03.490 --> 15:04.760
So that's where you learned carving and the like?

15:04.950 --> 15:05.670
You are?

15:05.960 --> 15:06.700
This is bad!

15:06.820 --> 15:07.870
My back is to the wall!

15:08.170 --> 15:09.240
It'll be fine.

15:09.530 --> 15:10.610
Please leave it to me!

15:11.160 --> 15:13.730
Finally, we have the Cosplay Outfit Creation Contest!

15:11.160 --> 15:13.730
Cosplay (コスプレ), or "costume play", is dressing up as a favorite character or to fit a favorite scenario. But be honest... you knew that, right?

15:13.830 --> 15:14.410
The models will be...

15:14.410 --> 15:15.600
These two!

15:16.460 --> 15:18.770
Why do they have to make cosplay outfits?!

15:18.860 --> 15:20.210
And what's more, you're making me a model?!

15:20.630 --> 15:23.910
Master needs to be able to make a maid outfit or something to stand a fighting chance!

15:24.000 --> 15:25.420
That's so heavy handed!

15:25.540 --> 15:27.050
There's no theme for this round!

15:27.340 --> 15:28.820
Feel free to make the clothes of your choice!

15:28.930 --> 15:30.090
Master, your model is Onee-chan.

15:30.210 --> 15:31.700
Seiichirou-kun gets Anna-san!

15:33.550 --> 15:35.390
Do your best, Seiichirou-kun!

15:36.150 --> 15:40.440
But I wonder why Seiichirou-kun can do something that Yoshitaka would do.

15:40.810 --> 15:43.510
Is it just my imagination or do those to make it seem like I'm seeing double?

15:45.460 --> 15:46.040
It's done!

15:46.230 --> 15:47.800
A summer clothing sailor suit for the outer layer with blue bloomer pants

15:47.930 --> 15:48.820
and topped off with bunny ears!

15:48.850 --> 15:49.870
I call it "Sailor Bunn-

15:49.870 --> 15:50.400
Oww!

15:50.400 --> 15:51.810
Die, you perverted bastard!

15:51.830 --> 15:53.290
It looks like Onee-chan didn't like it!

15:53.290 --> 15:53.930
Zero points!

15:53.930 --> 15:55.910
Now, how about Seiichirou-kun?

15:56.170 --> 15:58.060
Wh-What a wedding dress!

15:58.140 --> 15:59.920
Anna-san is so beautiful!

16:00.120 --> 16:01.730
This is... me?

16:02.280 --> 16:03.920
It really suits you, Anna-chan.

16:04.150 --> 16:08.790
Although it would have suited you even more if Yoshitaka had made a tuxedo or something for Izumi-san...

16:09.300 --> 16:10.180
Thank you very much!

16:10.600 --> 16:11.990
I'm sure I'll be very happy!

16:12.110 --> 16:14.120
Please be certain to attend the ceremony!

16:14.220 --> 16:15.810
He researched Anna-chan's weakness?!

16:16.180 --> 16:20.150
With this, it's straight victory... Quizzes, figurines, and outfit making!

16:20.380 --> 16:23.050
Just as promised, I'll be taking the maids!

16:23.230 --> 16:25.510
I feel like I've seen that face recently...

16:23.230 --> 16:25.510
Yes, Izumi is reading the HiMM manga. Volume 2, to be specific.

16:25.810 --> 16:27.320
Help me, Mitsuki-chan!

16:27.960 --> 16:29.370
It's fine, it's fine!

16:30.070 --> 16:31.280
I forgot!

16:31.520 --> 16:34.460
There's one more condition to employing us!

16:34.890 --> 16:35.850
Th-There's more?!

16:36.030 --> 16:38.280
We have a pet named Pochi.

16:38.530 --> 16:40.990
We want someone who can get along with Pochi.

16:41.060 --> 16:41.760
A pet?

16:41.940 --> 16:43.340
Is that all?

16:43.560 --> 16:44.130
Pochi!

16:44.330 --> 16:45.260
Come out!

16:48.070 --> 16:51.040
It's unfair that he hasn't had an appearance, so he's really on edge!

16:51.740 --> 16:52.730
So what's your decision?

16:53.270 --> 16:54.210
True...

16:54.960 --> 16:57.050
I can't deal with reptiles.

16:57.440 --> 17:02.180
Once, when I was young, we donated a python we were keeping at our house to the zoo.

17:02.910 --> 17:03.720
Oh, here it is!

17:04.780 --> 17:05.430
All right, move it!

17:08.730 --> 17:09.610
It's dark!

17:09.700 --> 17:10.450
I can't move!

17:10.490 --> 17:12.210
I'm scared!

17:13.040 --> 17:15.410
So taking care of Pochi is impossible, isn't it?

17:16.020 --> 17:17.090
Well, that's too bad.

17:17.940 --> 17:18.920
Go on and go home!

17:20.040 --> 17:20.770
What are you saying?!

17:20.980 --> 17:22.470
This is all for the sake of Izumi-san!

17:22.620 --> 17:25.490
No matter what I have to do, I'll overcome my dislike of reptiles!

17:27.320 --> 17:29.100
D-Do your best, Seiichirou-kun!

17:29.220 --> 17:29.960
Don't push yourself.

17:30.560 --> 17:33.000
As if there's something Yoshitaka can do that I can't...

17:33.440 --> 17:34.060
Pochi!

17:34.310 --> 17:36.490
If you listen to what I say, I'll give you something nice!

17:43.060 --> 17:44.360
HAPPY!

17:46.500 --> 17:48.540
And now there's nothing to talk about!

17:48.700 --> 17:51.590
I truly am suited to be their master!

17:51.930 --> 17:54.940
Hey, why are you carrying those things around with you?

17:55.520 --> 17:56.990
I was starting to wonder about this...

17:57.620 --> 18:01.800
But maybe Seiichirou-kun isn't all that different from Yoshitaka.

18:04.890 --> 18:05.950
We hit the mark!

18:06.760 --> 18:09.900
Just when I thought I was finally going to be free of that perverted Yoshitaka,

18:10.150 --> 18:13.450
It wouldn't be any different if I went with Seiichirou-kun!

18:14.250 --> 18:16.510
B-But even if my disposition is the same as Yoshitaka's...

18:16.540 --> 18:19.850
Even if I'm a lolicon uniform fetishist who loves peeping pictures, plays girls simulation games, and dresses in women's clothing...

18:19.890 --> 18:22.500
If I'm the same, then why don't you choose <i>me</i>?!

18:24.280 --> 18:26.520
Wasn't there one thing too many in what he just said?

18:26.630 --> 18:28.210
What are Yoshitaka's characteristics again?

18:28.490 --> 18:31.830
He's a lolicon uniform fetishist who loves peeping pictures and plays girl simulation games.

18:32.140 --> 18:33.940
What did Seiichirou-kun just say?

18:34.090 --> 18:34.980
Ready, and...

18:35.190 --> 18:38.760
He's a lolicon uniform fetishist who loves peeping pictures, plays girls simulation games,

18:38.840 --> 18:40.320
AND DRESSES IN WOMEN'S CLOTHING?!

18:41.740 --> 18:43.030
Crap!

18:48.080 --> 18:49.300
A major comeback!

18:49.560 --> 18:51.270
Seiichirou-kun wins!

18:52.530 --> 18:53.520
S-Stop joking!

18:53.620 --> 18:55.880
If we go with some weird guy, it won't be any different in the end!

18:56.160 --> 18:58.570
But he sounds like much more fun!

18:58.760 --> 18:59.140
N-No!

18:59.680 --> 19:00.900
No, no, no!

19:01.020 --> 19:02.430
Well then, Master.

19:02.560 --> 19:03.760
Thank you for looking after me!

19:04.180 --> 19:05.310
H-Hey, Mitsuki-chan!

19:05.440 --> 19:07.040
Don't tell me you're serious about this!

19:07.170 --> 19:10.210
Have I ever lied to you before?

19:10.370 --> 19:12.490
Ah, no, it's just that... earlier you said everything would be fine!

19:14.050 --> 19:16.730
Well, this is good-bye, Yoshitaka-kun.

19:17.350 --> 19:19.880
This is... ridiculous...

19:20.140 --> 19:21.330
Anna-san, here you are.

19:21.660 --> 19:24.060
A farewell present of weapons you can use!

19:24.330 --> 19:26.900
Think of Onee-chan when you see them, and please take care of them!

19:27.710 --> 19:30.970
Izumi-san is going to become unattainable to me, isn't she?

19:31.420 --> 19:32.190
I understand.

19:32.410 --> 19:35.900
Well, if Izumi-san is going to become happy, I'm the one thing who can do it!

19:32.410 --> 19:35.900
Anna-chan's slurring pronunciation of 'honmono' (本物 - "the real thing") also sounds like 'homo' (ホモ), the common Japanese term for homosexuals.

19:36.180 --> 19:37.190
I'll let her be.

19:37.360 --> 19:39.040
Now, shall we go?

19:39.180 --> 19:40.400
Yes, Master!

19:40.490 --> 19:41.670
W-Wait, Mitsuki!

19:42.010 --> 19:43.420
Are you really all right with this?

19:43.420 --> 19:43.930
Huh?

19:44.610 --> 19:47.270
But you've repaid your debt and Pochi is with us.

19:47.570 --> 19:50.650
We don't have a reason to stay here anymore.

19:50.970 --> 19:52.080
That's true, but...

19:52.530 --> 19:55.070
Even if Seiichirou-kun has some deviant hobbies,

19:55.110 --> 19:57.340
he doesn't look like he's as big of a pervert as Yoshitaka...

19:57.730 --> 19:59.710
Don't tell me you want to stay here?

19:59.980 --> 20:01.160
Why would you think that?!

20:01.250 --> 20:02.290
I don't!

20:02.330 --> 20:03.200
There's no <i>way</i> I would!

20:13.750 --> 20:14.380
Izumi.

20:14.880 --> 20:17.630
Were you just thinking that you wanted me to stop you?

20:18.360 --> 20:20.380
Wh-What are you saying? Of course I wasn't!

20:20.540 --> 20:23.070
The truth is that you want to stay by my side forever, don't you?

20:23.220 --> 20:24.140
Am I wrong?

20:24.390 --> 20:25.340
Say it!

20:25.490 --> 20:26.970
What are you... What's with you?

20:27.210 --> 20:29.880
Who do you think would <i>choose</i> to stay with you?!

20:30.120 --> 20:33.340
If you sincerely ask me to stop you, I'll do so.

20:33.550 --> 20:35.850
It's the least you could do as one of my maids.

20:36.080 --> 20:36.950
Wait.

20:37.150 --> 20:40.000
This is my ticket out of this place!

20:41.610 --> 20:44.570
I hope you live in solitude in this house for the rest of your life!

20:44.690 --> 20:45.850
That'd be perfectly fair!

20:46.010 --> 20:48.580
Farewell, bye-bye, take care of yourself, all RIGHT?!

20:48.850 --> 20:49.680
We're going, Mitsuki.

20:49.750 --> 20:50.410
Do you have Pochi?

20:50.500 --> 20:51.170
Yes!

20:51.310 --> 20:53.040
Hurry up and tell us what we need to know, Seiichirou-kun!

20:53.170 --> 20:53.960
Y-Yes!

20:58.010 --> 20:59.260
Onee-chan!

20:59.680 --> 21:00.620
What's wrong?

21:00.720 --> 21:01.880
Ah, I'm sorry!

21:03.070 --> 21:04.260
This is good, isn't it?

21:04.470 --> 21:05.790
Perfectly fair.

21:10.260 --> 21:12.090
Izumi-san is gone.

21:12.780 --> 21:15.220
I  may really become a nun now.

21:16.240 --> 21:18.670
I-I don't know what kind of face to make at a time like this.

21:18.990 --> 21:20.300
I guess you should laugh.

21:24.080 --> 21:26.090
You should use this room from now on.

21:26.560 --> 21:30.060
No need to hesitate; this apartment is all mine!

21:30.170 --> 21:31.530
All of it?!

21:32.740 --> 21:35.340
Of course, we'll prepare a room for Pochi as well.

21:38.730 --> 21:39.540
This is great, isn't it?

21:39.740 --> 21:42.080
I can't believe we have an apartment like this in the middle of the city!

21:43.250 --> 21:44.180
You're right.

21:44.800 --> 21:46.680
Today sure wore me out.

21:47.790 --> 21:49.700
I'm going to sleep.

21:50.880 --> 21:51.850
Onee-chan?

21:56.000 --> 21:59.240
Now then, I wonder what kind of pictures he took today.

22:00.440 --> 22:01.170
Huh?

22:27.380 --> 22:30.810
見た目の甘さほどは

22:27.380 --> 22:30.810
mitame no amasa hodo ha

22:27.380 --> 22:30.810
They only appear sweet for a moment

22:30.820 --> 22:34.560
儚いとか 弱くもないから

22:30.820 --> 22:34.560
hakanai to ka yowaku mo nai kara

22:30.820 --> 22:34.560
and they're not weak either.

22:34.590 --> 22:39.530
女の子は結構頑丈よ

22:34.590 --> 22:39.530
onnanoko ha kekkou ganjou yo

22:34.590 --> 22:39.530
Girls are pretty stable.

22:41.610 --> 22:44.820
意地っ張り空回りを

22:41.610 --> 22:44.820
ijippari karamawari wo

22:41.610 --> 22:44.820
Because they're stubborn,

22:44.900 --> 22:48.680
楽しめちゃう余裕も大事ネ!

22:44.900 --> 22:48.680
tanoshimechau yoyuu mo daiji ne!

22:44.900 --> 22:48.680
they can enjoy getting nothing done; free time is precious, too.

22:48.690 --> 22:53.410
笑顔にはたっぷりのスパイスが

22:48.690 --> 22:53.410
egao ni ha tappuri no SUPAISU ga

22:48.690 --> 22:53.410
Is there a good deal of spice in that smile?

22:54.110 --> 22:55.740
どうかナ?

22:54.110 --> 22:55.740
dou ka na?

22:54.110 --> 22:55.740
I wonder...

22:56.020 --> 23:02.140
常識など壊す刺激的なヒミツ

22:56.020 --> 23:02.140
joushiki nado kowasu shigekitekina himitsu

22:56.020 --> 23:02.140
The stimulating secret that smashes common sense,

23:02.270 --> 23:09.760
スカートでそっと巧く隠してる

23:02.270 --> 23:09.760
SUKATTO de sotto umaku kakushiteru

23:02.270 --> 23:09.760
is well-concealed within their skirts.

23:09.860 --> 23:16.640
愛情のカタマリでこの気持ち出来てる

23:09.860 --> 23:16.640
aijou no katamari de kono kimochi dekiteru

23:09.860 --> 23:16.640
I have a feeling this can be a mass of love.

23:16.900 --> 23:23.620
キュんとなるシュンカンを夢みていたいから

23:16.900 --> 23:23.620
KYUN to naru shunkan wo yume miteitai kara

23:16.900 --> 23:23.620
Because I want to have dreams of this moment, that will not matter.

23:23.940 --> 23:30.950
愛情のカタマリでオトメは進化する

23:23.940 --> 23:30.950
aijou no katamari de otome ha shinka suru

23:23.940 --> 23:30.950
The maidens grow in a mass of love,

23:31.010 --> 23:38.060
トキメキもカガヤキも抱きしめているから

23:31.010 --> 23:38.060
TOKIMEKI mo kagayaki mo dakishimeteiru kara

23:31.010 --> 23:38.060
because they are embracing their glowing excitement.

23:46.700 --> 23:48.390
This is such a great song!

23:48.520 --> 23:49.680
It doesn't suit you.

23:49.680 --> 23:51.180
Its such a refreshing song!

23:51.740 --> 23:52.970
Hello, this is Okui.

23:51.740 --> 23:54.010
Okui Masami is the singer who performs the opening song, "Trust".

23:53.000 --> 23:54.010
Everyone, you all look well.

23:54.670 --> 23:55.590
It's the real thing!

23:56.230 --> 23:57.040
Welcome!

23:57.230 --> 23:58.990
N-N-Nice to meet you!

23:59.120 --> 23:59.940
Okui-san!

24:00.020 --> 24:02.780
Please kick Izumi out and become a regular on this anime!

24:02.880 --> 24:03.660
What did you say?!

24:04.020 --> 24:04.980
More importantly, Yoshitaka-kun!

24:05.040 --> 24:05.420
Yes?

24:05.610 --> 24:08.500
You can't torment Izumi-chan so much!

24:08.240 --> 24:13.240
The Faraway Boyfriend, Yoshitaka

24:08.710 --> 24:10.500
Ah... I'm sorry.
